{"step_index":271,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:05:56Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-02T12:05:56+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-02T12:05:56+04:00\nFile Path: `file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh`\nTotal Lines: 110\nTotal Bytes: 4131\nShowing lines 50 to 85\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n50: \n51: # --- Garde-fou 2 : sauvegarde automatique avant toute modification ---\n52: backup=\"${zonefile}.bak.$(date +%Y%m%d%H%M%S)\"\n53: cp \"$zonefile\" \"$backup\"\n54: \n55: tmpfile=\"${zonefile}.acme.tmp.$$\"\n56: \n57: # Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond exactement\n58: # au label (évite les doublons/résidus d'une précédente émission).\n59: awk -v label=\"$label\" '$1 != label' \"$zonefile\" > \"$tmpfile\"\n60: \n61: if [ \"$action\" = \"add\" ]; then\n62:   if [ -z \"$value\" ]; then\n63:     echo \"add nécessite une valeur\" >&2\n64:     rm -f \"$tmpfile\"\n65:     exit 2\n66:   fi\n67:   printf '%s\\tTXT\\t\"%s\"\\n' \"$label\" \"$value\" >> \"$tmpfile\"\n68: fi\n69: \n70: # Faire avancer le serial SOA (format YYYYMMDDNN observé dans ce fichier).\n71: today=$(date +%Y%m%d)\n72: case \"$current_serial\" in\n73:   \"${today}\"*)\n74:     rev=$(echo \"$current_serial\" | cut -c9-10)\n75:     new_rev=$(printf '%02d' $((10#$rev + 1)))\n76:     new_serial=\"${today}${new_rev}\"\n77:     ;;\n78:   *)\n79:     new_serial=\"${today}01\"\n80:     ;;\n81: esac\n82: sed -i \"s/^\\([[:space:]]*\\)${current_serial}\\([[:space:]]*;[[:space:]]*serial\\)/\\1${new_serial}\\2/\" \"$tmpfile\"\n83: \n84: # --- Garde-fou 3 : vérifier que le serial a réellement été remplacé ---\n85: if ! grep -q \"${new_serial}[[:space:]]*;[[:space:]]*serial\" \"$tmpfile\"; then\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
